/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15 0 R
/E (            When a similar temptation returns later, the user can replay this past-self message to interrupt the usual habit loop and create a brief pause before acting. Rather than treating regret as a feeling that simply fades away, Rewind explores whether regret can be captured and brought back at the right time in a more approachable form.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
