/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15 0 R
/E (        Future work will focus on building and refining the full Rewind prototype, including episode archiving, AI-assisted replay generation, and character-mediated playback. This next phase will move the concept toward a more complete and usable system.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
39 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15 0 R
/E (            It will also examine whether users initiate replay during real temptation moments, whether replay creates a measurable decision pause before action, and how repeated use may shape habit frequency over time. A further direction is to compare no-reward replay with rewarded replay, while exploring how replay can support reflection without feeling overly judgmental or intrusive.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
